-- 217: Footer "Regional Training Centers" (SG footer CMS block, block_id = 7):
--      remove Bhutan, India and Nigeria; keep Singapore (1), Malaysia (2), Ghana
--      (renumbered 5 -> 3). Byte-exact REPLACE() via hex literals (generated from the
